A two-part project for Telefónica, La Cabina, helping companies understand how hybrid energy battery systems work, for both factory and residential use.

The first part is a website simulator where users select different modes based on available conditions, to see how the hybrid system responds. The second is a connected physical installation: selecting a mode and clicking through on the screen triggers that scenario to play out on the physical piece itself, linking the digital simulation to a live physical response.
